      "text": "# Task 2 preset: terrain-composition shift: more sand/rock/obstacles, larger patches.\n# TRUE simulator parameters; the rover never sees them (see docs/OBSERVATION_SCHEMA_V2.md).\nenv:\n  kind: advanced\n  size: 32\n  battery: 250\n  p_normal: 0.35\n  p_sand: 0.25\n  p_rock: 0.22\n  gen_corr: 3\n  energy_cost: [1, 3, 5]\n  slip_prob: [0.02, 0.1, 0.05]\n  sensor_miss: 0.05\n  sensor_false: 0.02\n  sensor_sigma: 0.05\nrun: {seed: 0, episodes: 1500, out_dir: results/sim32_terrain_shift}\n"
